{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "es",
  "language_raw": "Spanish",
  "source": "message/dat/Spanish/script/class_d_01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Spanish/script/class_d_01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_01",
      "hash64": "B867252596185671",
      "text": "Hola, queridos alumnos.\\nEspero que estéis todos estupendamente.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_02",
      "hash64": "B867222596185158",
      "text": "Permitid que me presente: My name is Silvio.\\n¿Lo habéis entendido? My... name... is... Silvio.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_03",
      "hash64": "B86723259618530B",
      "text": "¡Muy bien! Os veo muy atentos, ¡a lo que os\\nrespondo con un ferviente arigatō![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_04",
      "hash64": "B867282596185B8A",
      "text": "No os imagináis lo feliz que me hace poder\\nrevivir mi juventud junto a unos jóvenes tan\\r\\navispados como vosotros. I'm so happy![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_05",
      "hash64": "B867292596185D3D",
      "text": "¿Conocéis el origen de mi nombre, \"Silvio\"?\\c\\nProviene de una antigua palabra que significa\\n'selva' o 'bosque'.\\c\\n¡Conmigo os adentraréis en un gran bosque\\ndonde los árboles son las palabras![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 193,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_06",
      "hash64": "B867262596185824",
      "text": "Como bien os podréis imaginar, mis clases están\\ndedicadas a la lingüística.\\c\\n¡Os enseñaré lo mágicas y curiosas que pueden\\nresultar las palabras![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_07",
      "hash64": "B8672725961859D7",
      "text": "En otras partes del mundo no nos saludaríamos\\ncon \"hola\" o \"buenos días\", sino con \"hello\" y\\r\\n\"good morning\", por poner un simple ejemplo.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_08",
      "hash64": "B8671C2596184726",
      "text": "Hay incluso gente muy creativa que combina\\nvarios idiomas para crear sus propios saludos,\\r\\ncomo es el caso de una famosa streamer que\\r\\nutiliza el vocablo \"holichiwa\".[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_09",
      "hash64": "B8671D25961848D9",
      "text": "Este mundo está lleno de rincones maravillosos,\\n¡cada uno con su propio idioma![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_10",
      "hash64": "B86AAA25961B6E47",
      "text": "\"Arigatō\", \"merci\", \"xièxie\", \"danke schön\",\\n\"thank you\"... ¿Quién puede decirme qué tienen\\r\\nen común todas estas expresiones?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_d_01_select_01",
      "hash64": "6023657BE692D927",
      "text": "Todas significan 'adiós'",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_d_01_select_02",
      "hash64": "6023667BE692DADA",
      "text": "Todas significan 'gracias'",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_d_01_select_03",
      "hash64": "6023677BE692DC8D",
      "text": "Todas significan 'buenas noches'",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_answer_01",
      "hash64": "45494461C655FB1A",
      "text": "Te llamabas [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿no?\\c\\nMe temo que la respuesta no es correcta,\\npero el mero hecho de haberte expresado\\r\\nante el resto de la clase ya te honra. ¡Bravo![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_answer_02",
      "hash64": "45494361C655F967",
      "text": "Te llamabas [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿no?\\c\\nVery good! ¡Respuesta correcta! Y aplaudo,\\nademás, tu valor para lanzarte a hablar delante\\r\\nde toda la clase.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_answer_03",
      "hash64": "45494261C655F7B4",
      "text": "Te llamabas [VAR 0x0100(0000)], ¿no?\\c\\nMe temo que la respuesta no es correcta,\\npero el mero hecho de haberte expresado\\r\\nante el resto de la clase ya te honra. ¡Bravo![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_11",
      "hash64": "B86AA925961B6C94",
      "text": "\"Thank you\", \"merci\", \"xièxie\"... ¡Todas estas\\nexpresiones sirven para expresar gratitud!\\c\\nSeguro que os sonaba al menos una de ellas.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_12",
      "hash64": "B86AAC25961B71AD",
      "text": "En algunos idiomas las palabras son más largas;\\nen otros, más cortas. Y, por supuesto, cada uno\\r\\ntiene su propia fonética. ¿No es fascinante?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_13",
      "hash64": "B86AAB25961B6FFA",
      "text": "Y ahora, mis amantes de las palabras, permitid\\nque os dé un pequeño consejo.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_14",
      "hash64": "B86AA625961B677B",
      "text": "Cuando viajéis al extranjero, procurad aprender\\nal menos unas frases básicas en el idioma local.\\c\\nAunque solo lo chapurreéis un poco, os abrirá\\nmontones de puertas. ¡Y de corazones![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 183,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_15",
      "hash64": "B86AA525961B65C8",
      "text": "Seguro que los lugareños se alegran al ver como\\nos esforzáis por comunicaros con ellos. I promise![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_16",
      "hash64": "B86AA825961B6AE1",
      "text": "Sinceramente, basta con expresiones tan simples\\ncomo \"hola\", \"qué rico\" y \"gracias\". Os pueden\\r\\nvenir de perlas en cantidad de ocasiones.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_17",
      "hash64": "B86AA725961B692E",
      "text": "Y, por supuesto, cuando os falten las palabras...\\n¡aprovechad el poder del lenguaje corporal!\\c\\n¡No hay forma más natural de comunicarse!\\nImaginaos que sois un Mr. Mime y os saldrá solo.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 187,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_18",
      "hash64": "B86AA225961B60AF",
      "text": "Vaya, qué timbre tan inoportuno.\\nPues nada, ¡eso es todo por hoy![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_01_language_19",
      "hash64": "B86AA125961B5EFC",
      "text": "Au revoir, my dear friends. See you soon![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
